Provenance
==============================================================================

This repository contains only code, documents and design tokens written for
ASTERION Hub, plus the third-party components listed below. It contains no
source code, binary, resource, icon or research material taken from any
proprietary product. It does not store the installers it distributes: those
are published separately, with their SHA-256 hashes, in a signed catalog.

